<title>UK: London Japanese stocks mixed amid blue-chip buying.</title>
<headline>London Japanese stocks mixed amid blue-chip buying.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese shares traded in London were mixed on Friday with dealers reporting buying interest in exporters' issues.</p>
<p>&quot;People are encouraged by Tokyo's performance overnight and by the currency and they've bought all the stocks they were selling over the last few days,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>Sony Corp was 52.5 yen higher at 9,857.5 yen.</p>
<p>Dealers noted buying interest in bank stocks also.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
